conditions,

00:31:26.450 --> 00:31:28.990
you can think of all three
highlighted equations as

00:31:28.990 --> 00:31:31.230
conditions that c and d must
satisfy,

00:31:31.230 --> 00:31:35.050
because all three of these
conditions can be satisfied by a

00:31:35.050 --> 00:31:38.370
combination of c and d, Well,
then it is possible to make z

00:31:38.370 --> 00:31:40.850
using x and y.

