negative 1.

00:32:09.130 --> 00:32:13.670
Now I have 9, negative 16, and 2
instead of negative 1.

00:32:13.670 --> 00:32:16.970
That changes what the three
conditions that C and D need to

00:32:16.970 --> 00:32:18.790
satisfy are.
The first two are the same

00:32:18.790 --> 00:32:20.830
because the first two components
are the same.

00:32:20.830 --> 00:32:22.570
The third is different.

00:32:22.570 --> 00:32:26.950
Right, before we had 2C plus 3D
